  "title": "Ryser's conjecture",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture Let $H$ be an $r$-uniform $r$-partite hypergraph. If $\\nu$ is the maximum number of pairwise disjoint edges in $H$, and $\\tau$ is the size of the smallest set of vertices which meets every edge, then $\\tau \\le (r-1) \\nu$.",
